on exitFrame
  [  0] pushcons 0 .............................. <EMPTY>
  [  2] pushint8 3 .............................. <3>
  [  5] set 0 ................................... set the keyDownScript to EMPTY
  [  7] pushint8 7 .............................. <7>
  [ 10] pushcons 8 .............................. <"hezstnd">
  [ 12] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [ 13] pushint8 10 ............................. <10>
  [ 16] get 9 ................................... <the number of member "hezstnd">
  [ 18] pushint8 35 ............................. <35>
  [ 21] set 6 ................................... set the memberNum of sprite 7 to the number of member "hezstnd"
  [ 23] pushint8 7 .............................. <7>
  [ 26] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [ 27] pusharglistnoret 2 ...................... <7, 0>
  [ 29] extcall 15 .............................. puppetSprite(7, 0)
  [ 31] pushint8 5 .............................. <5>
  [ 34] pusharglist 1 ........................... <5>
  [ 36] extcall 22 .............................. <random(5)>
  [ 38] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 41] eq ...................................... <random(5) = 1>
  [ 42] jmpifz [ 51] ............................ if random(5) = 1 then
  [ 45] pushcons 16 ............................. <"rabbit">
  [ 47] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <"rabbit">
  [ 49] extcall 2 ............................... go("rabbit")
  [ 51] ret
end
